# SHELVED 2026-08-31: an AVAudioSession sketch. It calls an `av-audio-session-form` binding that was never
# declared (no dock, no form), so it has nothing to compile against. Nothing loads it. Un-shelve by binding
# AVAudioSession.sharedInstance().requestRecordPermission through a runtime shim, the camera pattern.
note draft

task request-access
  fork case
    call av-audio-session-form/shared-instance/request-record-permission
      wait true
    case av-audio-session-form/record-permission/granted
      term granted
    case av-audio-session-form/record-permission/denied
      term denied
    case av-audio-session-form/record-permission/undetermined
      term unknown
